  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Experience unmatched luxury on scenic 30A in this stunning 18-bedroom, 15 full-bath, 2 half-bath beachfront estate that sleeps up to 44 guests — the ultimate destination for large family vacations, reunions, corporate retreats, and special celebrations. Just steps from the sugar-white sands and emerald Gulf waters, this expansive coastal home offers a wealth of resort-style amenities and thoughtful touches throughout.<br><br>Step outside to your own private 24' × 60' heated pool and spa, where endless fun and relaxation await. The first-floor outdoor space features a poolside grill, perfect for barbecues and alfresco dining with family and friends. When you're ready for more entertainment, head to the fully equipped game room with a pool table, arcade games, and plenty of space for friendly competition.<br><br>Inside, you'll find spacious, beautifully designed living areas with coastal elegance and comfort. Enjoy movie nights in the dedicated home theater, and effortlessly access every level with the in-home elevator. Multiple gathering spaces and expansive windows offer breathtaking views and an inviting atmosphere for group activities or quiet relaxation.<br><br>With luxurious amenities, thoughtful design, and an unbeatable location near premier dining, boutique shopping, and easy beach access, this extraordinary 30A estate redefines large-group coastal living.<br><br>Unwind, entertain, and create lasting memories at this exceptional 30A beachfront retreat with poolside grilling, panoramic Gulf views, and luxury for every guest.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "28 Maple Street - Luxury Home in 30A Suitable for Beach Retreats & Large Groups"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
